%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-core-functions-sizeof (関数ページ)
doc と相違 (doc の Output と実 DW の出力の値が一致しない)
doc の Output:
  {
    "sizeOfSting2": 9,
    "sizeOfEmptyString": 0,
    "sizeOfNumber": 1
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
{
  sizeOfSting2 : sizeOf("my string"),
  sizeOfEmptyString: sizeOf(""),
  sizeOfNumber : sizeOf("123" as Number)
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "sizeOfSting2": 9,
  "sizeOfEmptyString": 0,
  "sizeOfNumber": 3
}
